# 2. CODE BEHAVIOR & ARCHITECTURE
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# - Authentication: Handled via Supabase Auth (Email/Password). User metadata and 
#   WhatsApp numbers are stored in a linked public `profiles` table.
# - Product Uploads: Sellers can log in, click "Sell Item", fill in product details, 
#   and select actual device image files. These files are uploaded directly to 
#   Supabase Storage bucket (`product-images`), returning public URLs stored in the `products` table.
# - Buyer Interaction: Buyers can browse products across devices/browsers in real time 
#   and click "💬 WhatsApp" to chat instantly with the exact seller who posted the item.

